      "widgets_values": [
        "MATCHED PRESET A/B TEST \u2014 scene 08, Open Source Must Win (1:10\u20131:20)\nRun one preset at a time. Keep the prompt, both pictures, audio, seed, width, height and frames identical in A and B.\nDefaults: seed 256623654 (fixed), 1344 \u00d7 768, 243 frames / 24 fps = 10.125 seconds. No upscale, face refinement or interpolation.\nA: http://192.168.1.100:8194    B: http://192.168.1.100:8189 \u2014 Workflows > SoundVision A-B Tests.\nThe tabs are separate; edits do not synchronize. After each test finishes: Comfy menu (top left) > Edit > Unload Models and Execution Cache, then switch tabs.\nThis compares the complete presets (model, Turbo, sampler, attention and decoder). It does not isolate the checkpoint alone."
